	ɜ:[+ long]ɹ ɑ:[+ long]ɹ ɔ:[+ long]ɹ e:[+ long]ɹ o:[+ long]ɹ i:[+ long]ɹ u:[+
				long]ɹ > ɜ:[+ long] ɑ:[+ long] ɔ:[+ long] ɛə ɔə ɪə ʊə / syllable-finally
	ɑ > ɒ
	æ > æ:[+ long] / _{F:[- voice],N:[- voice]}
	æ:[+ long] > ɑ:[+ long] / _{F:[- voice],N:[- voice]}
	ɒ > ɒ:[+ long] / _F:[- voice]
	ɒ:[+ long] > ɔ:[+ long] / _F:[- voice]
